# MERN conventions

- Backend validators live in `server/src/validators/`; use validate middleware on routes.
- Keep REST under `/api/v1` and existing JSON response helpers.
- Frontend API calls should respect `NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL`.
- Checkout is COD-first; do not imply a live payment gateway without a PRD.
- Read `.agents/rules/mern-stack.md` for the full rule list.
